{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__18_.gif?t=1740379245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>99 Fails is a tight 2D precision platformer set in Zeebo's weird nightmare.</strong>\u00a0<strong>You\u2019ll test your rhythm, timing, and skill as enemies and the environment fight to break your flow!</strong> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1740379245\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A platforming game anyone can play, but very few can master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bizarre artful visions &amp; monsters with music by David Wise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master three unique mechanics &amp; race friends online to the finish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete with everyone in an endless level online - there can be only one!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/movie_040-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1740379245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/FJ_-_99_Fails_Steam_mode_adventure.png?t=1740379245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play through 5 areas with checkpoints and unlock 3 addictive mechanics with just 99 lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn about Zeebo's intriguing background story and the world of Neebota.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> After beating Adventure mode, ragequit Adventure+ mode with permadeath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/99FailsGameplayPreviewTrailer-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1740379245\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/FJ_-_99_Fails_Steam_mode_arcade.png?t=1740379245\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenge yourself by traversing 99 or 666 pillars with no checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Have friends &amp; foes join as you feverishly race to the end with up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Do daily challenges and be the first to find all collectibles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1740379245\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1740379245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/movie_039-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1740379245\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/FJ_-_99_Fails_Steam_mode_endless.png?t=1740379245\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Face the ultimate challenge 99 Fails has to offer - an endless playthrough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete with an endless amount of people in the same session.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Win fame &amp; glory by being number one during checkpoint events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1740379245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1740379245\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akam